      "content": "i don't know... it doesn't feel like that. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just dragging them down. they deserve someone who actually carries the torch, someone who doesn't make them feel ashamed every time they look at me. sometimes i think if i just weren't here, if i just stopped being this constant disappointment, they'd finally be able to breathe again. everything would just be... clean. like the mistake was finally gone.",
